OL,3,AEric Bauza, voice of Bugs Bunny and
OL,4,ADaffy Duck, dies aged 46
OL,5,
OL,6,FEric Bauza, the voice artist behind
OL,7,FLooney Tunes characters including Bugs
OL,8,FBunny, Daffy Duck and Porky Pig, has
OL,9,Fdied aged 46.
OL,11,FA statement from the Emmy award-winning
OL,12,Fstar's family posted on Instagram said
OL,13,Fhe had died "suddenly".
OL,15,FBauza had voiced a number of characters
OL,16,Fin this summer's animated hit Coyote
OL,17,Fvs. Acme, and appeared in the recent
OL,18,Frelease Forgotten Island.
OL,20,FVariety reports that the cause of death
OL,21,Fwas hypertensive cardiovascular disease
OL,22,Fand that Bauza died at home on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
